 285:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_Ext_CP_Clk.c **** *
 286:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_Ext_CP_Clk.c **** * Summary:
 287:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_Ext_CP_Clk.c **** *  Gets the clock divider register value.
 288:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_Ext_CP_Clk.c **** *
 289:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_Ext_CP_Clk.c **** * Parameters:
 290:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_Ext_CP_Clk.c **** *  None
